---
title: Own Environment
---

# Own Environment

This page brings its own CSS and JavaScript. frontflow renders it in a
sandboxed frame and does not touch the markup.

```{html}
<style>
  .card { border: 2px solid rebeccapurple; padding: 1rem; border-radius: .5rem; }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; color: rebeccapurple; }
</style>
<div class="card">
  <h3>Computed in your browser</h3>
  <p id="live">script did not run</p>
</div>
<script>
  document.getElementById('live').textContent =
    'script ran at ' + new Date().toISOString().slice(11, 19);
</script>
```

## An ojs cell

```{ojs}
answer = 40 + 2
```
